   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Discord moderation flag\nFlags messages that look like spam or abuse to a mod channel. It never deletes or bans.\n\n**Setup:** add credentials to each node, replace every REPLACE_ME, test with one item, then activate.\n\n**Guardrails:** Flag-only. A human moderator takes every action.\n\nBad or empty input stops the run and alerts you. No secrets are stored in this file.",
    "height": 220,
    "width": 560
   },
   "id": "discord-moderation-flag-note",
   "name": "Read me",
